meta {
  name: Update job
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "title": "Senior Frontend Developer (React)",
    "salaryMax": 80000,
    "isActive": true,
    "skills": [
      { "slug": "typescript", "required": true },
      { "slug": "react", "required": true }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  Update a job. Run **Create job** first to fill `jobId`.

  Every field is optional: omitted fields stay unchanged, `null` clears a nullable field. `skills` (slugs) replace the whole list. `isActive: false` hides the job from the list. The company of a job cannot change.

  - 200: OK - the updated job, shaped like a job list item
  - 400: invalid body or id, salaryMin above salaryMax, unknown location or skill slug
  - 404: unknown id
  - 409: the company already has a job with this `sourceUrl` or `externalId`
  - 401: run Login
}